## EXECUTION DISCIPLINE

- One module/concern per commit. Build green before committing.
- Run commands directly in the terminal (no agentic editor churn).
- After each change: `cargo build 2>&1 | grep -E "warning|error"` must be clean
  (or show only tracked, intentional allows).
- `session-backup` branch holds the prior working attempt — recover proven code
  from it (hidden_apps, nav) rather than rewriting blind.

